ille","Congo Republic","Congo-Brazavile","Congo-Brazzaville","Departements der Republik Kongo","Französisch-Kongo","Kongo","Kongo (Republik)","Kongo-Brazzaville","RC","Rep. Congo","Repubblica del Congo","Republic of Congo","Republic of the Congo","Republiek Congo","Republik Kongo","Republika Konga","Republique du Congo","República del Congo","República do Congo","Res publica Congensis","République du Congo","cg","Δημοκρατία του Κονγκό","Конго","Конго-Браззавиль","Республика Конго","جمهورية الكونغو","جمهوری کنگو","कांगो गणराज्य","コンゴ・ブラザヴィル","コンゴ共和国","刚果","刚果 (布)","刚果共和国","刚果（布）","剛果共和國","布拉柴维尔刚果"]}